<title>GERMANY: Italy's Prodi to visit Bonn on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Italy's Prodi to visit Bonn on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Prime Minister Romano Prodi is to visit Bonn on Thursday for informal talks with Chancellor Helmut Kohl, a German government spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Spokesman Peter Hausmann said in a statement that Kohl had invited the Italian leader to join him for dinner at his private bungalow in the grounds of the Bonn chancellery.</p>
</text>
